font-family: 굴림, gulim; font-size: 11pt;\">지원내용</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 0pt; padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17.3333px; text-indent: -13.3333px; line-height: 31.2px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;1.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; font-size: 11pt;\">동아리 활동 수당&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">인당&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">1,200,000</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">원 지원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim;\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; font-size: 11pt;\">회당&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">200,000</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; font-size: 11pt;\">원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">/&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; font-size: 11pt;\">총&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; font-size: 11pt;\">회</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 0pt; padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17.3333px; text-indent: -13.3333px; line-height: 31.2px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; font-size: 11pt;\">회의비</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; font-size: 11pt;\">전문가 활용비 등 모임에 소모되는&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">일부 비용 지원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim;\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; font-size: 11pt;\">총&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; font-size: 11pt;\">회 지원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 0pt; padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17.3333px; text-indent: -13.3333px; line-height: 31.2px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;3.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; font-size: 11pt;\">창업지원단 창업 중점교수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; font-size: 11pt;\">외부 기술 전문가 컨설팅</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 0pt; padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17.3333px; text-indent: -13.3333px; line-height: 31.2px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;*&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">전문멘토 직접추천 가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">추천이 없을 시 협회에서 분야별 매칭</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">),&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">간접지원</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 0pt; padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17.3333px; text-indent: -13.3333px; line-height: 31.2px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;4.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; font-size: 11pt;\">동아리실&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; font-size: 11pt;\">창업 및 회의공간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; font-size: 11pt;\">지원&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; font-size: 11pt;\">경북</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">ICT</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; font-size: 11pt;\">이노베이션스퀘어</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; font-size: 11pt;\">김천</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">))</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 0pt; padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17.3333px; text-indent: -13.3333px; line-height: 31.2px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; ○&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; font-size: 11pt;\">결과물&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; font-size: 11pt;\">비즈니스모델</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(BM)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; font-size: 11pt;\">계획서&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">15</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; font-size: 11pt;\">페이지 내외&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; font-size: 11pt;\">양식 별도 제공</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 0pt; padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17.3333px; text-indent: -13.3333px; line-height: 31.2px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; ○&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; font-size: 11pt;\">우수동아리 시상식</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: 2022.12.01. (</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; font-size: 11pt;\">예정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 20.1pt; padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17.3333px; line-height: 31.2px; text-indent: -20.1pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; font-size: 11pt;\">비즈니스모델 성과확산을 위한 워크숍 개최</span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 20.1pt; padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17.3333px; line-height: 31.2px; text-indent: -20.1pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -20.1pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">○&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -20.1pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim; font-size: 11pt;\">동아리 활동 일정&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -20.1pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(22.6</span><span style=\"text-indent: -20.1pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim; font-size: 11pt;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -20.1pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">~ 22.9</span><span style=\"text-indent: -20.1pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim; font-size: 11pt;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -20.1pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"13304\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17.3333px; text-indent: -13.3333px;\"></div><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17.3333px; text-indent: -13.3333px; line-height: 31.2px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><b>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">◆기타 지원내용은 첨부 파일 참조&nbsp;</span></b></span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 0pt; padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17.3333px; text-indent: -13.3333px; line-height: 31.2px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><b></b></span></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"13125\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17.3333px; text-indent: -13.3333px;\"></div><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 88pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17.3333px; text-indent: -88pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></b></span></p><p class=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 88pt; padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 17.3333